  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Demografisk unders&#xf6;kning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demographic Survey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN:s befolkningsfond UNFPA genomf&#xf6;rde 1999 en studie om demografin, socio-ekonomin och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa i Kosovo. Studien beh&#xf6;ver uppdateras och d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r s&#xf6;ker UNFPA, Statistikbyr&#xe5;n i Kosovo samt &quot;Ministry of Public Services st&#xf6;d men framf&#xf6;r allt f&#xf6;r att ge underlag som kan stimulera en &#xf6;kad samh&#xe4;llsdebatt, med m&#xf6;jliga politiska beslut , inom omr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r fr&#xe4;mst ungdomar och kvinnor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 1999 UNFPA completed a Kosovo-wide household-based Demographic, Socio-economic and Reproductive Health Survey.Today there is a need to update the data. UNFPA have together with their national  counterparts i.e. Ministry of Public Services and Statistical Office of Kosovo proposed that the survey should be updated and give information that will support decisions important to youth and gender</narrative>
  </description>
